ence_id":"calib_003_s6","report_id":"calib_003","text":"As shown in Figure 1, Baseline achieves 65.5% test accuracy on SVHN.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"calib_003_s7","report_id":"calib_003","text":"Figure 2 shows the training loss.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"calib_003_s8","report_id":"calib_003","text":"As shown in Figure 2, at epoch 9, the loss of ResNet-50 is 0.186.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"calib_003_s9","report_id":"calib_003","text":"At epoch 8, the loss of Baseline is 0.136 (Figure 2).","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"calib_003_s10","report_id":"calib_003","text":"At epoch 12, the loss of Baseline is 0.203 (Figure 2).","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"calib_003_s11","report_id":"calib_003","text":"SVM reaches 54.2% accuracy on Tiny-ImageNet.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"calib_003_s12","report_id":"calib_003","text":"The differences between the models are discussed in the next section.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"}]}